WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:05.038
- RICK NICKLESBY REPORTING LIVE
FROM A GRUESOME SCENE.

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:08.408
A CULT KNOWN AS Q.E.T.,
OR QUEST FOR ETERNAL TRUTH,

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:11.545
HAS APPARENTLY TAKEN THEIR
OWN LIVES IN A MASS SUICIDE.

00:00:11.545 --> 00:00:14.581
POLICE CONFIRM THAT
CYANIDE-LACED CHERRY KOOL-AID

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.617
WAS ALSO ON THE PREMISES.

00:00:16.617 --> 00:00:18.518
EXCUSE ME. HI.
RICK NICKLESBY, CHANNEL 6.

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:20.254
HI. ARE YOU TWO
FROM THE NEIGHBORHOOD?

00:00:20.254 --> 00:00:21.989
- YES.
- NO.

00:00:21.989 --> 00:00:23.524
- NO.
- YES.

00:00:23.524 --> 00:00:25.859
[both speaking gibberish]

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:28.195
- OKAY, WERE YOU TWO MEMBERS
OF THE CULT THAT LIVED HERE?

00:00:28.195 --> 00:00:29.363
- THE CUL--WHAT CULT?

00:00:29.363 --> 00:00:30.697
- WHAT?
- WAS THIS A CULT RIGHT HERE?

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:32.032
- CULT?
- I HAD NO IDEA THIS WAS A CULT.

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:33.066
- NO WAY.
- A CULT?

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:34.201
- ALTHOUGH I WILL SAY,

00:00:34.201 --> 00:00:35.736
THE TERM "CULT"
IS A LITTLE JUDGMENTAL.

00:00:35.736 --> 00:00:37.037
- I WOULD SAY
THE SAME THING, YEAH.

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:38.405
- NOT KNOWING THE FULL DOCTRINE.
- MM-HMM, MM-HMM.

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:40.007
- WELL, APPARENTLY,
THEY BELIEVED THAT THERE WAS

00:00:40.007 --> 00:00:41.842
A SPACESHIP WAITING FOR THEM
BEHIND THE MOON.

00:00:41.842 --> 00:00:44.344
- OKAY, WELL, YOU KNOW,
THAT STILL IS REALLY POSSIBLE.

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:45.712
- NOT COMPLETELY CRAZY.
- IT'S POSSIBLE, RIGHT?

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:47.681
I MEAN, WHO KNOWS WHAT IS
OUT THERE IN THE UNIVERSE?

00:00:47.681 --> 00:00:49.049
- ANYTHING COULD BE
BEHIND THE MOON.

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.584
- OKAY, WELL, IT APPEARS
THEY KILLED THEMSELVES

00:00:50.584 --> 00:00:52.019
IN ORDER TO BOARD THE SHIP.

00:00:52.019 --> 00:00:53.520
- RIGHT, AND THAT'S WHERE
WE DISAGREED WITH THEM,

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:54.688
RIGHT THERE,
OR WOULD HAVE--

00:00:54.688 --> 00:00:56.390
WE WOULD HAVE DISAGREED
WITH THEM

00:00:56.390 --> 00:00:58.058
HAD WE BEEN THERE
ON OUR DEPARTURE DAY--

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:00.160
THEIR DEPARTURE DAY.
THEIR DEPARTURE DAY!

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.094
- YEAH.
- WHICH IS THE DAY

00:01:01.094 --> 00:01:02.763
THAT THEY DID THIS.

00:01:02.763 --> 00:01:04.231
I MEAN, THAT'S WHAT YOU
COULD CALL IT,

00:01:04.231 --> 00:01:05.866
IF YOU WANTED TO--
I AIN'T IN NO CULT.

00:01:05.866 --> 00:01:08.702
- NO, I MEAN, WHAT I ALWAYS
WONDERED IS HOW--

00:01:08.702 --> 00:01:10.304
OR AM STARTING TO WONDER,

00:01:10.304 --> 00:01:12.906
SINCE YOU BROUGHT THIS
TO OUR ATTENTION--

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:15.042
WHY--IF THERE WAS A SPACESHIP
IN THE SKY,

00:01:15.042 --> 00:01:17.611
WHY WOULDN'T IT JUST
BEAM US UP--BEAM THEM UP?

00:01:17.611 --> 00:01:19.713
- RIGHT, JUST BEAM 'EM--
JUST BEAM THEM UP.

00:01:19.713 --> 00:01:21.114
WHY CAN'T YOU JUST
BEAM THEM UP ALIVE?

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:22.783
WHY YOU GOT TO BE DEAD
TO GET BEAMED UP?

00:01:22.783 --> 00:01:24.051
YOU KNOW WHAT I'M SAYING?

00:01:24.051 --> 00:01:25.452
I'VE BEEN SAYING THAT
FOR WEEKS--SECONDS.

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:27.521
FOR SECONDS, 'CAUSE--
BECAUSE YOU, RICK NICKLESBY,

00:01:27.521 --> 00:01:29.756
YOU TOLD US THAT,
YOU KNOW,

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:31.158
AND THAT'S HOW I KNEW,
BECAUSE--

00:01:31.158 --> 00:01:32.559
- 15 SECONDS AGO.
- 15 SECONDS AGO, YOU SAID IT.

00:01:32.559 --> 00:01:34.428
I DIDN'T KNOW ANYTHING ABOUT IT
UNTIL YOU SAID IT,

00:01:34.428 --> 00:01:35.629
'CAUSE I AIN'T IN NO CULT.

00:01:35.629 --> 00:01:37.564
- OKAY, THEN WHY WOULD SOMEONE
JOIN A CULT?

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:39.633
- COMPELLING LEADERSHIP.
- CHARISMATIC LEADER.

00:01:39.633 --> 00:01:41.335
- [stammering]
LIKE, A COMPELLING--

00:01:41.335 --> 00:01:42.936
- TACO TUESDAYS.
- A PERSON--

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.304
- TACO TUESDAYS.
- TACO TUESDAYS.

00:01:44.304 --> 00:01:45.405
- I MEAN, HYPOTHETICALLY,

00:01:45.405 --> 00:01:46.773
THEY COULD HAVE HAD TACOS
ON TUESDAY,

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:47.774
WHICH WOULD HAVE BEEN A DRAW.

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:48.775
I MEAN, THAT WOULD HAVE BEEN
A PLUS.

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:51.244
- OKAY, SO THIS IS
A TRAGIC DAY

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:52.546
FOR THIS COMMUNITY

00:01:52.546 --> 00:01:55.682
AND FOR THE MEMBERS
OF THE QUEST FOR EARTHLY TRUTH.

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:58.652
I'M RICK NICKLESBY REPORTING--

00:01:58.652 --> 00:02:00.020
WHOA.

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:00.988
- YOU SEE?
- YEP.

00:02:00.988 --> 00:02:02.422
- YOU SEE?
- UH-HUH.

00:02:02.422 --> 00:02:04.524
EVERYBODY JUMPED THE GUN.
- [gasping]

00:02:04.524 --> 00:02:07.861
- WE'RE READY!
- [laughing]

